WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.884 --> 00:00:05.137
- Hi, my name is Gustav.

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:07.018
My co-worker, Stephanie loves sloths.

00:00:07.018 --> 00:00:08.458
Everyday she talks about sloths.

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:10.594
- There's three different
species of sloths.

00:00:10.594 --> 00:00:14.286
(audio fast forwarding)

00:00:14.286 --> 00:00:17.411
I just love sloths, they're
just like the greatest animal

00:00:17.411 --> 00:00:19.478
and I'm gonna get emotional.

00:00:19.478 --> 00:00:21.243
- So, me, being the nice guy that I am,

00:00:21.243 --> 00:00:23.077
I reached out to the
Wildlife Learning Center

00:00:23.077 --> 00:00:24.702
and asked if they had a sloth

00:00:24.702 --> 00:00:26.908
that we could borrow for a couple of hours

00:00:26.908 --> 00:00:28.394
so that we could surprise Stephanie

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:30.252
with her favorite animal.

00:00:30.252 --> 00:00:32.134
(cheerful upbeat music)

00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:47.795
- What?

00:00:47.795 --> 00:00:48.558
Sloths?

00:00:49.718 --> 00:00:50.874
Sloths!

00:00:53.585 --> 00:00:56.290
Are you serious, Gustav?

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:58.101
No, we talk about this all the time.

00:00:58.101 --> 00:01:00.158
I'm going to, one day.

00:01:00.158 --> 00:01:01.741
(squealing)

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:04.667
(Gustav laughing)

00:01:11.174 --> 00:01:13.072
This is not happening.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:18.277
I can't breathe, oh my god.

00:01:22.369 --> 00:01:23.611
How'd you get him here?

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:29.011
This is the greatest day of my life.

00:01:29.011 --> 00:01:30.100
Oh my god.

00:01:34.463 --> 00:01:37.601
Oh my god, someone,
someone call my girlfriend.

00:01:37.601 --> 00:01:38.382
Oh my god.

00:01:38.382 --> 00:01:40.457
Gustav, you're my best
friend in the whole world.

00:01:40.457 --> 00:01:43.498
If you ever need a kidney, I have two.

00:01:43.498 --> 00:01:45.375
Oh my god.

00:01:49.643 --> 00:01:54.409
(camera shutter clicks)

00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:57.132
I don't wanna give final thoughts

00:01:57.132 --> 00:01:59.546
'cause that means it's over
and I don't want it to be over.

00:01:59.546 --> 00:02:01.778
This is the greatest
experience of my life.

00:02:03.812 --> 00:02:06.825
Oh my god, I'm so happy.

00:02:06.825 --> 00:02:10.922
Oh my god, I'm so happy.

00:02:10.922 --> 00:02:12.339
I'm so happy.

